'''Metal Hippoe''' (メタルカバちゃん, ''Metarukaba-chan'', '''Metal Hippo-chan''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] variant of [[Hippoe]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]], [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]], and [[The Aku Realms]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]].

